---
import Kivirik from '../Kivirik.astro';
---

<section class="section privacy on-dark noodles" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="copy">
      <span class="pill">Gizlilik</span>
      <h2 id="privacy-title">Senin paran, senin bilgin.</h2>
      <p>
        erişte’nin bankanla işi yok. Aboneliklerini katalogdan seçersin; kart ya da banka bilgini, konumunu, rehberini istemeyiz. Uygulamada da bu sitede de
        izleme yok.
      </p>
      <a href="/gizlilik" class="link">Gizlilik politikasını oku →</a>
    </div>

    <ul class="nos">
      <li>
        <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M8 20 L24 10 L40 20 M10 20 H38 M14 24 V34 M24 24 V34 M34 24 V34 M8 38 H40" />
            <path class="x" d="M6 6 L42 42" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <div>
          <h3>Banka bağlamak yok</h3>
          <p>Banka hesabı ya da kart bilgisi istemeyiz. Premium ödemesi bile Apple üzerinden; kart bilgin bize gelmez.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M8 20 V28 H14 L30 36 V12 L14 20 Z M36 18 C39 20 39 28 36 30" />
            <path class="x" d="M6 6 L42 42" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <div>
          <h3>Reklam yok</h3>
          <p>Uygulamada reklam yok, reklam SDK’sı yok, reklam kimliğine dokunmayız.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M4 24 C10 14 17 10 24 10 C31 10 38 14 44 24 C38 34 31 38 24 38 C17 38 10 34 4 24 Z" />
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="6" />
            <path class="x" d="M6 6 L42 42" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <div>
          <h3>İzleme yok</h3>
          <p>Üçüncü taraf analitik yok, takip yok. Bu sitede çerez bile yok.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="kv">
      <Kivirik pose="mutlu" label="Kıvırık mutlu" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .privacy {
    position: relative;
  }
  .grid {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 36px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
      align-items: center;
      column-gap: 56px;
    }
    .kv {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 2;
    }
    .nos {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    }
  }
  .copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-items: start;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 3.25rem);
    color: #f5f3f7;
  }
  .copy p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    max-width: 42ch;
  }
  .link {
    color: var(--safran);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .nos {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .nos li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: var(--r-card);
    background: var(--card);
  }
  .ico {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 197, 61, 0.12);
    color: var(--safran);
  }
  .ico svg {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
  }
  .ico .x {
    stroke: var(--biber);
    stroke-width: 4;
  }
  .nos h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #f5f3f7;
    margin: 4px 0 6px;
  }
  .nos p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.9688rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .kv {
    width: min(200px, 55vw);
  }
</style>
